<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Jan 18 totalled 137.342 million, versus a revised 136.786 million in the previous week and 135.286 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 166.912 million, versus a revised 169.284 million the previous week and 168.535 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
